      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plural Owns, Singular Adds\nMany links exist in two versions:\n\n| Link | Plural resource: owns the whole list\n| Singular resource: adds one item |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Apps that may use a connection |\n`auth0_connection_clients` |\n`auth0_connection_client` |\n| Actions bound to a trigger |\n`auth0_trigger_actions` |\n`auth0_trigger_action` |\n| Scopes of an API |\n`auth0_resource_server_scopes` |\n`auth0_resource_server_scope` |\n| Permissions of a role |\n`auth0_role_permissions` |\n`auth0_role_permission` |\n\nA plural resource writes exactly its own list\nand removes everything else. A singular\nresource appends one item and ignores the\nrest. The provider warns not to use both for\nthe same parent ([connection clients](https://\ngithub.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob\n/v1.63.0/docs/resources/connection_client.md#L\n11-L14); [trigger actions](https://github.com/\nauth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/do\ncs/resources/trigger_actions.md#L11-L13)).\nChoose one style for each parent, across all\nrepos and states.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-82312bd34668",
      "originalText": "Plural Owns, Singular Adds\nMany links exist in two versions:\n\n| Link | Plural resource: owns the whole list | Singular resource: adds one item |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Apps that may use a connection | `auth0_connection_clients` | `auth0_connection_client` |\n| Actions bound to a trigger | `auth0_trigger_actions` | `auth0_trigger_action` |\n| Scopes of an API | `auth0_resource_server_scopes` | `auth0_resource_server_scope` |\n| Permissions of a role | `auth0_role_permissions` | `auth0_role_permission` |\n\nA plural resource writes exactly its own list and removes everything else. A singular resource appends one item and ignores the rest. The provider warns not to use both for the same parent ([connection clients](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/docs/resources/connection_client.md#L11-L14); [trigger actions](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/docs/resources/trigger_actions.md#L11-L13)). Choose one style for each parent, across all repos and states.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "plural-owns-singular-adds"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1029065832,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-40135bbde6ac",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
