    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5697560043,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-40135bbde6ac",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1288.8,
      "y": 905.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 210.0,
      "seed": 384227,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Connection Options Are One Document\nThe `options` block of an `auth0_connection`\nholds the details of a sign-in method, such as\nthe directory of an identity provider and its\nclient secret. The provider sends `options` as\none whole document. The docs warn that every\nnested field must be set, or existing settings\ncan be lost ([connection doc](https://github.c\nom/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0\n/docs/resources/connection.md#L14)). So a\nsmall change to one option rewrites them all,\nwith the values that Terraform knows.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-40135bbde6ac",
      "originalText": "Connection Options Are One Document\nThe `options` block of an `auth0_connection` holds the details of a sign-in method, such as the directory of an identity provider and its client secret. The provider sends `options` as one whole document. The docs warn that every nested field must be set, or existing settings can be lost ([connection doc](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/docs/resources/connection.md#L14)). So a small change to one option rewrites them all, with the values that Terraform knows.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "connection-options-are-one-document"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3223978623,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-8ca3228e3c1d",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1276.8,
      "y": 1160.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
