    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7406759408,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-8ca3228e3c1d",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1288.8,
      "y": 1160.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 332.5,
      "seed": 947888,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Actions Have Three States\nAn action is code that runs in a flow, such as\n`post-login`. It has three states ([write your\nfirst action](https://auth0.com/docs/customize\n/actions/write-your-first-action)):\n\n1. A draft. `auth0_action` saves the code, and\nwith the default `deploy = false` it stays a\ndraft.\n2. A deployed version. With `deploy = true`,\nthe code becomes the live version.\n3. Bound to a flow. Only a binding, through\n`auth0_trigger_actions` or\n`auth0_trigger_action`, makes the action run.\n\nSo a code change in Terraform can stay a\ndraft, and a deployed action can stay unused.\nA bound action with `deploy = true`, however,\nchanges live sign-ins at the next apply.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-8ca3228e3c1d",
      "originalText": "Actions Have Three States\nAn action is code that runs in a flow, such as `post-login`. It has three states ([write your first action](https://auth0.com/docs/customize/actions/write-your-first-action)):\n\n1. A draft. `auth0_action` saves the code, and with the default `deploy = false` it stays a draft.\n2. A deployed version. With `deploy = true`, the code becomes the live version.\n3. Bound to a flow. Only a binding, through `auth0_trigger_actions` or `auth0_trigger_action`, makes the action run.\n\nSo a code change in Terraform can stay a draft, and a deployed action can stay unused. A bound action with `deploy = true`, however, changes live sign-ins at the next apply.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "actions-have-three-states"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1296918412,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-b40422f9593e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1276.8,
      "y": 1420.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
      "seed": 69966,
      "groupIds": [],
