    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1616474756,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-b40422f9593e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1288.8,
      "y": 1420.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 297.5,
      "seed": 988939,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "State Is a Secrets Store\nThe state of an Auth0 configuration holds\nseveral kinds of secret:\n\n- The client secrets of applications, in\n`auth0_client_credentials`.\n- The `secrets` of actions, in plain text\n([action doc](https://github.com/auth0/terrafo\nrm-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/docs/resources/\naction.md#L16-L18)).\n- The client secret of an identity provider,\ninside connection `options`.\n\nNewer provider versions add write-only\narguments, such as `secrets_wo` and\n`client_secret_wo`, which keep a value out of\nthe state. They need Terraform 1.11 or later.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-b40422f9593e",
      "originalText": "State Is a Secrets Store\nThe state of an Auth0 configuration holds several kinds of secret:\n\n- The client secrets of applications, in `auth0_client_credentials`.\n- The `secrets` of actions, in plain text ([action doc](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/docs/resources/action.md#L16-L18)).\n- The client secret of an identity provider, inside connection `options`.\n\nNewer provider versions add write-only arguments, such as `secrets_wo` and `client_secret_wo`, which keep a value out of the state. They need Terraform 1.11 or later.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "state-is-a-secrets-store"
      }
    },
