      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3131660267,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-df8837358f72",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 1680.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 612.5,
      "seed": 293823,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What You Will See\n| Resource | Auth0 object | What to check |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `auth0_client` | application | `app_type`,\ncallback and origin lists |\n| `auth0_client_credentials` | sign-in method\nand secret of an application | Where the\nsecret goes next |\n| `auth0_resource_server` | API | Its\nidentifier, which tokens use as the audience |\n| `auth0_client_grant` | access of an\napplication to an API | Which scopes,\nespecially on the Management API |\n| `auth0_connection` | sign-in method |\n`strategy`, a complete `options` block, secret\nsources |\n| `auth0_connection_client(s)` | apps enabled\non a connection | Singular or plural, and who\nelse manages them |\n| `auth0_action`, `auth0_trigger_action(s)` |\ncode in a flow, and its binding | `deploy`,\nruntime, secrets, where the binding lives |\n| `auth0_role`, `auth0_organization` | access\ngroups | Who assigns users to them |\n| `auth0_log_stream` | export of tenant logs |\n`type`, `filters`, the target |\n| `auth0_tenant`, `auth0_branding`,\n`auth0_prompt` | tenant-wide settings |\nExactly one owner per tenant |\n\nAn application of type `non_interactive` is a\nmachine-to-machine application. A client grant\nto the Management API lets such an application\nchange the tenant itself, so these grants\ndeserve a careful look.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-df8837358f72",
      "originalText": "What You Will See\n| Resource | Auth0 object | What to check |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `auth0_client` | application | `app_type`, callback and origin lists |\n| `auth0_client_credentials` | sign-in method and secret of an application | Where the secret goes next |\n| `auth0_resource_server` | API | Its identifier, which tokens use as the audience |\n| `auth0_client_grant` | access of an application to an API | Which scopes, especially on the Management API |\n| `auth0_connection` | sign-in method | `strategy`, a complete `options` block, secret sources |\n| `auth0_connection_client(s)` | apps enabled on a connection | Singular or plural, and who else manages them |\n| `auth0_action`, `auth0_trigger_action(s)` | code in a flow, and its binding | `deploy`, runtime, secrets, where the binding lives |\n| `auth0_role`, `auth0_organization` | access groups | Who assigns users to them |\n| `auth0_log_stream` | export of tenant logs | `type`, `filters`, the target |\n| `auth0_tenant`, `auth0_branding`, `auth0_prompt` | tenant-wide settings | Exactly one owner per tenant |\n\nAn application of type `non_interactive` is a machine-to-machine application. A client grant to the Management API lets such an application change the tenant itself, so these grants deserve a careful look.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "auth0-what-you-will-see"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9217218476,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-bc6e0f055b2e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1309.2,
      "y": 1940.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
      "seed": 728156,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3,
        "value": 8
      },
      "boundElements": [
