        "node_id": "auth0-plan-signals"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7069849506,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-fb752c7dfef1",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 2200.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 350.0,
      "seed": 628076,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plan Signals\n| Line in the plan | Meaning |\n| --- | --- |\n| `+` on an object that exists in the tenant |\nSomeone deleted it in the dashboard, or\nanother state deleted its link; Terraform\nrecreates it. |\n| `~` on `options` of a connection | The whole\noptions document will be rewritten. |\n| `~ cross_origin_auth = true -> null` in\nevery plan | A field with a server default\nthat the code does not set ([issue 1029](https\n://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/i\nssues/1029)). |\n| `~` on `auth0_trigger_actions` | The plural\nbinding will write its exact list; bindings\nmade elsewhere disappear. |\n| `-/+ auth0_log_stream` | The stream is\nreplaced; a stream to AWS EventBridge gets a\nnew partner event source. |",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-fb752c7dfef1",
      "originalText": "Plan Signals\n| Line in the plan | Meaning |\n| --- | --- |\n| `+` on an object that exists in the tenant | Someone deleted it in the dashboard, or another state deleted its link; Terraform recreates it. |\n| `~` on `options` of a connection | The whole options document will be rewritten. |\n| `~ cross_origin_auth = true -> null` in every plan | A field with a server default that the code does not set ([issue 1029](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/issues/1029)). |\n| `~` on `auth0_trigger_actions` | The plural binding will write its exact list; bindings made elsewhere disappear. |\n| `-/+ auth0_log_stream` | The stream is replaced; a stream to AWS EventBridge gets a new partner event source. |",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "auth0-plan-signals"
      }
    },
