    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9865456947,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-4ce16aa51659",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1872.4,
      "y": 2460.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 280.0,
      "seed": 691641,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mixed Trigger Bindings\n`auth0_trigger_actions` writes its exact list\nof actions on every create and update, and\nwrites an empty list on destroy. So its\ndestroy unbinds every action of the flow,\nincluding actions that another configuration\nbound with `auth0_trigger_action` ([code](http\ns://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/\nblob/v1.63.0/internal/auth0/action/resource_tr\nigger_actions.go#L76-L139)).\n`auth0_trigger_action` also cannot set the\norder: it appends its action at the end of the\nflow ([trigger action doc](https://github.com/\nauth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/do\ncs/resources/trigger_action.md#L10-L12)). Bind\nall actions of one flow in one place.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-4ce16aa51659",
      "originalText": "Mixed Trigger Bindings\n`auth0_trigger_actions` writes its exact list of actions on every create and update, and writes an empty list on destroy. So its destroy unbinds every action of the flow, including actions that another configuration bound with `auth0_trigger_action` ([code](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/internal/auth0/action/resource_trigger_actions.go#L76-L139)). `auth0_trigger_action` also cannot set the order: it appends its action at the end of the flow ([trigger action doc](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/docs/resources/trigger_action.md#L10-L12)). Bind all actions of one flow in one place.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "mixed-trigger-bindings"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1693580666,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-cb8532742bfb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1860.4,
      "y": 2720.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "#FEF3C7",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
      "seed": 722727,
      "groupIds": [],
