    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3220453713,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-cb8532742bfb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1872.4,
      "y": 2720.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 262.5,
      "seed": 698123,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two States, One Object\nTwo configurations can manage the same object\nwithout knowing it. For example, the create of\n`auth0_client_grant` adopts an existing grant\nfor the same application and API ([grant code]\n(https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-a\nuth0/blob/v1.27.0/internal/auth0/client/resour\nce_grant.go#L70-L96)). When either\nconfiguration destroys it, the other loses it.\nA `data \"auth0_client\"` lookup by name returns\nthe first match, so a duplicate name silently\npicks the wrong application ([data source code\n](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-\nauth0/blob/v1.63.0/internal/auth0/client/data_\nsource.go#L314-L340)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-cb8532742bfb",
      "originalText": "Two States, One Object\nTwo configurations can manage the same object without knowing it. For example, the create of `auth0_client_grant` adopts an existing grant for the same application and API ([grant code](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.27.0/internal/auth0/client/resource_grant.go#L70-L96)). When either configuration destroys it, the other loses it. A `data \"auth0_client\"` lookup by name returns the first match, so a duplicate name silently picks the wrong application ([data source code](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/internal/auth0/client/data_source.go#L314-L340)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "two-states-one-object"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2591353749,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-7b4228ff18ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1860.4,
      "y": 2980.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "#FEF3C7",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
      "seed": 917095,
      "groupIds": [],
