    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3369190377,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-212aacd5db73",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1872.4,
      "y": 3500.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 227.5,
      "seed": 662162,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Empty Secret Without Scope\nIf Terraform's application lacks\n`read:client_keys`, `client_secret` reads as\nan empty string, with no error ([credentials d\noc](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provide\nr-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/docs/resources/client_cre\ndentials.md#L182)). A configuration that\ncopies the secret into AWS Secrets Manager or\ninto an action secret then stores an empty\nvalue. The plan looks clean, and the app fails\nto sign in later. A `postcondition` that\nchecks the length of the secret catches this\nat plan time.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-212aacd5db73",
      "originalText": "Empty Secret Without Scope\nIf Terraform's application lacks `read:client_keys`, `client_secret` reads as an empty string, with no error ([credentials doc](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/docs/resources/client_credentials.md#L182)). A configuration that copies the secret into AWS Secrets Manager or into an action secret then stores an empty value. The plan looks clean, and the app fails to sign in later. A `postcondition` that checks the length of the secret catches this at plan time.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "empty-secret-without-scope"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6290592401,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-062d41d86ba5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
