    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3671954667,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-062d41d86ba5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1872.4,
      "y": 3760.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 262.5,
      "seed": 229118,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Connection Options Replaced Whole\nBecause `options` is one document, an update\nsends all of it. Fields that the code leaves\nout are wiped, secrets included, and\n`ignore_changes` inside `options` does not\nprevent this ([issue 860](https://github.com/a\nuth0/terraform-provider-auth0/issues/860)).\nWithout the options scopes, the API leaves\n`options` out of its answers, and updates that\ncontain `options` fail ([options scope](https:\n//auth0.com/docs/troubleshoot/product-lifecycl\ne/deprecations-and-migrations/migrate-connecti\non-options-scope)). Write the full `options`\nblock, and add a precondition that the secret\ninputs are not empty.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-062d41d86ba5",
      "originalText": "Connection Options Replaced Whole\nBecause `options` is one document, an update sends all of it. Fields that the code leaves out are wiped, secrets included, and `ignore_changes` inside `options` does not prevent this ([issue 860](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/issues/860)). Without the options scopes, the API leaves `options` out of its answers, and updates that contain `options` fail ([options scope](https://auth0.com/docs/troubleshoot/product-lifecycle/deprecations-and-migrations/migrate-connection-options-scope)). Write the full `options` block, and add a precondition that the secret inputs are not empty.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "connection-options-replaced"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
