    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1558312029,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-6da763786c8a",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1897.6,
      "y": 4292.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 192.5,
      "seed": 961617,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deploy and Bind\nWith the default `deploy = false`, a code\nchange in `auth0_action` stays a draft, and\nnothing changes for users. With `deploy =\ntrue`, the change goes live at once in every\nflow that binds the action. Deleting an action\nthat is still bound fails with `409 Conflict`.\nUnbind it in one apply, and delete it in the\nnext ([trigger actions doc](https://github.com\n/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/d\nocs/resources/trigger_actions.md#L17-L19)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-6da763786c8a",
      "originalText": "Deploy and Bind\nWith the default `deploy = false`, a code change in `auth0_action` stays a draft, and nothing changes for users. With `deploy = true`, the change goes live at once in every flow that binds the action. Deleting an action that is still bound fails with `409 Conflict`. Unbind it in one apply, and delete it in the next ([trigger actions doc](https://github.com/auth0/terraform-provider-auth0/blob/v1.63.0/docs/resources/trigger_actions.md#L17-L19)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "deploy-and-bind"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2722201591,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-0864a35b180f",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1885.6,
      "y": 4536.5,
